					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="2" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#70">Today...</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							Today I quit the guild also and passed it on to Gameldor, one of the founding members. As of today I am freelance and still consider you all my friends, but I wont be leader at this time. Its too crappy of a game when someone takes it more seriously then a friendship in RL and places Leveling above their RL Friendship.<br />
<br />
Have fun and take care, Im sure Gameldor and Megorth and Epstien will lead the guild just fine ... so will all the rest of you .<br />
<br />
A
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							<br>
														<strong>By:</strong>
							<span class="name"> <a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=188">Angelena </a> at 1:35 PM PST - January 21st, 2001</span>
						</td>
					</tr>
					</table>
				</td>
			</tr>
			</table>
			<p>
						<table width="95%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="2" class="border" border="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="2" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#69">Tieral Quits guild</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							After refusing to leave Spire 2 in South Karna last night to run to the Treants and SoW the Group he was in to help break up the spawn(apparently they had all went LD at once, while he was looting a Tree Corpse), Tieral decided to leave the guild.<br />
I have no hard feelings about it, because I am not someones SoW pimp, nor do I feel obligated to leave my camp when I was making almost a 1/4 to 1/2 bubble of exp per Kite from Spire 2. <br />
I have not ignored people if I had time to help or was in the available area to help and unoccupied. <br />
At the same time I have NEVER asked for ANYONES help retrieving my Corpse or gettting out of a bad situation I had gotten myself into. <br />
This I feel is a Individuals decision about if they have time to help and can leave their camp to help someone out in the guild. I am all for passing along Hand me down Items, power-leveling peoples Lowbies or even some newbies. I am all for making a character on my acct to help someone out if they wish to start their own guild. <br />
I will not, however, feel obligated to drop my own camp for helping a group that could have just regrouped long enough to kite one Tree off the Spawn and kill or Kite the second one off while Tieral logged in, co-ordinating the log in time with Altarial whom was also there to tell him to log in NOW.<br />
IF anyone wants to leave the guild over this feel free to do so. I personally dont give a damn. TO me the guild is about having fun, making friends, and passing along Items and Information, and the occasional PP if they have it, and just hanging out in general. I may step down because of this. I dont feel the obligation to make us A Uber guild complete with 5 page website and 200 members. If someone else feels so let me know. They can, but they have to be one of the founding members to be made leader,I;ll gladly pass it over to them.<br />
<br />
Take care, have fun, dont take a GAME more seriously then real life.<br />
<br />
A
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							<br>
														<strong>By:</strong>
							<span class="name"> <a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=188">Angelena </a> at 8:14 AM PST - January 21st, 2001</span>
						</td>
					</tr>
					</table>
				</td>
			</tr>
